kinds.design_spec.identifier => lands on members(scheme)
kinds.design_spec.language => lands on scalar:string
shelves.decisions.path => lands on scalar:string
regimes.language.ste_house => lands on members(tag controlled profile source_form retired_terms)
regimes.lifecycle.standard.transitions => lands on map of seq of scalar:string
regimes.lifecycle.standard.transitions.draft => lands on seq of scalar:string
regimes.lifecycle.standard.transitions.draft.0 => inside the list at `regimes.lifecycle.standard.transitions.draft`
core.requires => lands on seq of one of 4 alternatives
core.requires.0 => inside the list at `core.requires`
projections.0 => inside the list at `projections`
kinds.decision.sections.require.0 => inside the list at `kinds.decision.sections.require`
identifier_schemes.decision_id.pattern.prefix => below the scalar at `identifier_schemes.decision_id.pattern`
facets.status.values => lands on seq reference:allowed of one of 2 alternatives
package.optional.forbids => undeclared at `package`
vocabularies.lifecycle_state => lands on seq of one of 2 alternatives
